        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-704, Petal Dome Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Petal Cabinet Knob simplifies the flower and makes it a beautiful adornment to any kitchen cabinet without demanding too much attention. It leaves the impression of a floral knob without being overly feminine. Available in 2 sizes: the 1-1/4 inch diameter small petal knob and the 1-1/2 inch large petal knob. This floral cabinet hardware made by RK International is available in 6 finishes including satin nickel (pictured) and distressed copper.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International Fancy Petal Cabinet Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-704:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-703:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
